    "text": "By Country Herald Police Reports ,\n6 hours ago Country Herald is Local News, Independent Pulse. Covering breaking local news, sports, lifestyle and events. Monroe, NC – A Union County man was arrested this week after allegedly trying to flee in a detective’s unmarked vehicle, according to the Union County Sheriff’s Office. Deputies say the incident unfolded on Old Monroe Marshville Road when narcotics detectives encountered a suspicious person later identified as Justin Wayne Simpson. Authorities allege Simpson approached […] This content first appeared on CountryHerald.com and is protected by copyright law. Unauthorized reproduction, redistribution, or republication of this content, in whole or in part, without expressed written permission from Country Herald is strictly prohibited. Violators may be subject to legal action. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 5",
